  "text": "Policy Memo Project\n\nOverview. Over the second half of the semester you will write a 4-page policy memo on a market intervention of your choice (minimum wage, a carbon tax, rent control, etc.), addressed to a fictional city official.\n\nMilestones\n- Annotated outline due Monday, November 9 at 11:59 PM (submit on Canvas, one page)\n- Draft due Monday, November 16 at 11:59 PM\n- Final memo due Monday, December 7 at 11:59 PM\n\nGrading. Draft 20%, final 70%, outline 10%. Memos that skip the outline can't earn higher than a B on the final.\n\nResources. The Writing Center offers sessions for policy memos. See the sample memo under Files.",
